(7596299, 1225179, 87808, '<td valign="top">The glass for me makes this picture.  I mean I love the picture, it is old and weathered and definitely abandoned, but that glass, is it lead glass? was it stained at one point, does weather and neglect do this, was it PS? Really well done to lead teh eye to it  Or at least my eye.</td>', 'The glass for me makes this picture.  I mean I love the picture, it is old and weathered and definitely abandoned, but that glass, is it lead glass? was it stained at one point, does weather and neglect do this, was it PS? Really well done to lead teh eye to it  Or at least my eye.', '2018-09-13 18:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7596300, 1225775, 87808, '<td valign="top">That looks like a bullet shot! The glass is so clean, amazing really, defiantly abandoned.</td>', 'That looks like a bullet shot! The glass is so clean, amazing really, defiantly abandoned.', '2018-09-13 18:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7596301, 1225130, 87808, '<td valign="top">It does look weathered and worn, not sure it is abandoned though.  But by western standards, I guess it does look it. But I remember walking streets in Thailand and finding wonderful weathered homes that where falling down and people lived in them. The fire extinguishers though!</td>', 'It does look weathered and worn, not sure it is abandoned though.  But by western standards, I guess it does look it. But I remember walking streets in Thailand and finding wonderful weathered homes that where falling down and people lived in them. The fire extinguishers though!', '2018-09-13 18:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7596302, 1225258, 87808, '<td valign="top">That looks like a bit like a 40''s International Harvester Truck, possibly. And by the looks of it, had Bonnie and Clyde in it at one point! =)</td>', 'That looks like a bit like a 40''s International Harvester Truck, possibly. And by the looks of it, had Bonnie and Clyde in it at one point! =)', '2018-09-13 19:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
