(7596388, 1225118, 114285, '<td valign="top">Lol, your story or lack of it was funny nevertheless, and well I think if you need to over do the processing in a challenge, this challenge calls for it, because after all who wants to see a whole lot of derelict items in their natural form, pretty depressing, so I say, just GO FOR IT! Congrats, and I got a one too, so aren''t we both lucky ;/</td>', 'Lol, your story or lack of it was funny nevertheless, and well I think if you need to over do the processing in a challenge, this challenge calls for it, because after all who wants to see a whole lot of derelict items in their natural form, pretty depressing, so I say, just GO FOR IT! Congrats, and I got a one too, so aren''t we both lucky ;/', '2018-09-14 02:44:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7596392, 1225860, 87808, '<td valign="top">You did get a 1, and then a 2 and several 3''s.  I do not think that is fair to be honest. I will tell you this though, your outtakes, gave me goosebumps and one of them make me tear up. Holy hell, why did you not use any one of those.  They are heart-wrenching. I mean come on, tears in the eyes from a voter????!!! These are so amazing, so totally heartbreaking, so ripping on the emotions. I feel, and this is only me okay, do not label anyone else weird.  That you felt that the others would have been too much, would have felt like you exploited just for a photo and done it just so you could win a Ribbon. But that is not the case, this rally expresses some emotion, this is natural, this is what kids do. Sod what anyone else feels. Express real life, even if it hurts others, because it might offend, hurt, upset.  But in the end, you are the one conveying the emotions in the photos adn you are dictating what people feel. And in your outtakes, I feel what you are expressing.</td>', 'You did get a 1, and then a 2 and several 3''s.  I do not think that is fair to be honest. I will tell you this though, your outtakes, gave me goosebumps and one of them make me tear up. Holy hell, why did you not use any one of those.  They are heart-wrenching. I mean come on, tears in the eyes from a voter????!!! These are so amazing, so totally heartbreaking, so ripping on the emotions. I feel, and this is only me okay, do not label anyone else weird.  That you felt that the others would have been too much, would have felt like you exploited just for a photo and done it just so you could win a Ribbon. But that is not the case, this rally expresses some emotion, this is natural, this is what kids do. Sod what anyone else feels. Express real life, even if it hurts others, because it might offend, hurt, upset.  But in the end, you are the one conveying the emotions in the photos adn you are dictating what people feel. And in your outtakes, I feel what you are expressing.', '2018-09-14 03:22:08.000000', NULL, 0),
