(7596443, 1225367, 31829, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Oranges pushed a bit too far, but what a find. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I really did not touch the orange. This equipment looks like that with a setting sun. thanks for the comment though.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Oranges pushed a bit too far, but what a find.   I really did not touch the orange. This equipment looks like that with a setting sun. thanks for the comment though.', '2018-09-14 13:29:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7596446, 1225179, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nicely found and captured. I love the way you have handled the colors -- lovely muted blues, greens and red. You have made it sing while showing restraint by not pushing it too far. <br/> <br/>I get what you are saying about titles. I agree an option to leave it blank would be nice. Part of me thinks a good image should be able to stand on its own. Yet for some strong images a good title can add context or strengthen an emotional connection. I do envy some folks here that seem to be able to generate creative, thought provoking titles with ease. At times, the best I can musters is "The ________".</td>', 'Nicely found and captured. I love the way you have handled the colors -- lovely muted blues, greens and red. You have made it sing while showing restraint by not pushing it too far.  I get what you are saying about titles. I agree an option to leave it blank would be nice. Part of me thinks a good image should be able to stand on its own. Yet for some strong images a good title can add context or strengthen an emotional connection. I do envy some folks here that seem to be able to generate creative, thought provoking titles with ease. At times, the best I can musters is "The ________".', '2018-09-14 15:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7596448, 1225775, 19825, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shell. Congrats on the HM and new hardware. They say it is not about the equipment, but it can be a factor. A faster, more responsive machine means you can more easily explore your creativity in processing.</td>', 'Beautiful shell. Congrats on the HM and new hardware. They say it is not about the equipment, but it can be a factor. A faster, more responsive machine means you can more easily explore your creativity in processing.', '2018-09-14 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7596841, 1225851, 80096, '<td valign="top">This has such as eerie feeling to it. I like the way you captured the mist over the mountain in the background. It adds a forlorn aura to the capsized boat. Very well done.</td>', 'This has such as eerie feeling to it. I like the way you captured the mist over the mountain in the background. It adds a forlorn aura to the capsized boat. Very well done.', '2018-09-17 23:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
